.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH hs-intake 1 2026-08-11 "sandogasa 0.19.2" "Sandogasa Manual"
.SH NAME
hs\-intake \- Hyperscale package intake tool — compare RPM package metadata between branches
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBhs\-intake\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Hyperscale package intake tool — compare RPM package metadata between branches
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH COMMANDS
.SS hs-intake compare-build-requires
\fBhs\-intake compare\-build\-requires\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-show\-unchanged\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fISRPM\fR> <\fISOURCE_BRANCH\fR> <\fITARGET_BRANCH\fR> 
.PP
Compare the BuildRequires of a source package between two branches
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Output as JSON
.TP
\fB\-\-show\-unchanged\fR
Also show unchanged entries
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fISRPM\fR>
Source RPM name (e.g. "systemd")
.TP
<\fISOURCE_BRANCH\fR>
Branch to compare from (e.g. "rawhide")
.TP
<\fITARGET_BRANCH\fR>
Branch to compare to (e.g. "c10s\-hyperscale")
.SS hs-intake compare-provides
\fBhs\-intake compare\-provides\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-show\-unchanged\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fISRPM\fR> <\fISOURCE_BRANCH\fR> <\fITARGET_BRANCH\fR> 
.PP
Compare the Provides of a source package between two branches
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Output as JSON
.TP
\fB\-\-show\-unchanged\fR
Also show unchanged entries
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fISRPM\fR>
Source RPM name (e.g. "systemd")
.TP
<\fISOURCE_BRANCH\fR>
Branch to compare from (e.g. "rawhide")
.TP
<\fITARGET_BRANCH\fR>
Branch to compare to (e.g. "c10s\-hyperscale")
.SS hs-intake compare-requires
\fBhs\-intake compare\-requires\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-show\-unchanged\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fISRPM\fR> <\fISOURCE_BRANCH\fR> <\fITARGET_BRANCH\fR> 
.PP
Compare the Requires of a source package between two branches
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Output as JSON
.TP
\fB\-\-show\-unchanged\fR
Also show unchanged entries
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fISRPM\fR>
Source RPM name (e.g. "systemd")
.TP
<\fISOURCE_BRANCH\fR>
Branch to compare from (e.g. "rawhide")
.TP
<\fITARGET_BRANCH\fR>
Branch to compare to (e.g. "c10s\-hyperscale")
.SS hs-intake safe-to-backport
\fBhs\-intake safe\-to\-backport\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-also\-check\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fISRPM\fR> <\fITARGET_BRANCH\fR> <\fISOURCE_BRANCH\fR> 
.PP
Check if a source package is safe to backport between branches
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Output as JSON
.TP
\fB\-\-also\-check\fR \fI<ALSO_CHECK>\fR
Additional branches to check for reverse dependencies (comma\-separated)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fISRPM\fR>
Source RPM name (e.g. "systemd")
.TP
<\fITARGET_BRANCH\fR>
Branch to backport to (e.g. "c10s\-hyperscale")
.TP
<\fISOURCE_BRANCH\fR>
Branch to take the package from (e.g. "rawhide")
